  "title": "Flash Pizza",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s cheesy, pepperoni-topped pizzas are made with an easy, no-yeast dough that delivers a crispy, chewy texture and a slightly tangy taste in every bite.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
