  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups self-rising flour, or more as needed",
    "1.5 teaspoons white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons finely grated Parmigiano-Reggiano cheese",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 cup plain Greek yogurt",
    "1 teaspoon water, or as needed",
    "2 tablespoons cornmeal, divided",
    "0.667 cup pizza sauce, divided",
    "8 ounces low-moisture mozzarella cheese, shredded",
    "0.25 cup finely grated Parmigiano-Reggiano cheese, divided",
    "26 slices pepperoni, divided",
    "2 teaspoons olive oil, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 500 degrees F (260 degrees C). Mix 2 cups self-rising flour, sugar, and Parmigiano-Reggiano cheese for dough in a bowl until well combined. Add olive oil and Greek yogurt and mix with a spoon until a shaggy dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pAGhdm8p5c9KZOINJjd_MR6j6EI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-02-8c0c3a2edbe24377a8f3322da13c01c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Clean off the spoon and mix the dough with your hands until it mostly comes together.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/otvFe49ajd3sUpeEFOw7Jxe1tq4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-03-d4f82da81660494ca3ab7deccfcf0254.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer dough to a work surface and continue pushing it together until it smooths out. It will be dry; don't be tempted yet to add more liquid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-7MrF-6h-Du2SwEUU4lxY1WCnRE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-04-3ce8f919edc24b4c85543adeb389420a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead dough until smooth and elastic, 3 to 4 minutes, only adding a teaspoon or two of water or flour if absolutely necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Vax5nASU3maRcs93Tjewr59Jby8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-05-373763b79e764e34a415b3b982017bb6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut dough into two equal pieces. Line a rimmed baking sheet with parchment paper and sprinkle 1 tablespoon cornmeal over the surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0QrooS1-Jkuhsl1ePGOFaEWDjyw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-06-1-e67f10fcb60841eea5706ef80919d0a0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll one piece dough on a lightly floured surface to an 1/8-inch-thick rectangle. Transfer to the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sGW90QEciKRNwPazHXyK2691EIo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-07-1-16414adcdc3845dfba3cbe298e7554b4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top dough with ½ of the pizza sauce, spreading it almost, but not quite all the way, to the edges. Sprinkle ½ of the mozzarella over the sauce, then ½ of the Parmigiano-Reggiano over top. Arrange ½ of the pepperoni slices over the cheese, then drizzle 1 teaspoon oil over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OMitdgXoTrIJMfv9DIphtd7lBd0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-08-f54039097c72460bb946127e6e99a32b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the center of the preheated oven until crust is beautifully browned and toppings are bubbly, about 15 minutes. Transfer to a wire rack and let sit for 5 minutes before slicing and serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2uwaIVjCQwmTDypz2hIWDpMFJpo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-step-09-2-e622d8f126114479a0040b1605de019d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "As soon as you remove the pizza from the oven, repeat Steps 7 to 9 to top and bake second pizza.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xhEdVWdcPXelERN1i5ZDIo4pU7g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8372366-flash-pizza-VAT-4x3-2-b7dfd9aa55ef4f34ae26570222451645.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8372366/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
